PSF tensor provenance
---------------------
The file summicron/_artifacts/codev_render_v1.npz is a table of point spread
functions simulated with CODE V from the sample design "ag_dblgauss" (a generic
double-Gauss of about 100 mm focal length at f/2). It contains no measured
Leica data. It is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, together
with the rest of this repository.

Third-party model weights
-------------------------
The optional monocular depth fallback uses Depth Anything V2 Small
(Apache-2.0). Its weights are downloaded from Hugging Face at first use and are
not redistributed in this repository or in the wheel.

